5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable system. I'll look into the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, as well as the management office rate sheet and billing.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to know the actual time commitment. I'll check the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure fairness, I'll examine the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm tired of the inconsistency. I'll look into what each housemate counts as done and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I want us to stay friends, so I'll check the rows recorded in the house chat and the note left by the previous tenants.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
