59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"We have three options: Standing Assignments, a Paid Cleaning Service, or a Fixed Weekly Rota. Given the costs and the friction we've discussed, I'm inclined toward the Paid Cleaning Service for the sake of transparency.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I'm still wary of the time we'd spend tidying for a service, but a Fixed Weekly Rota seems too rigid given the absences Benjamin mentioned. I'll vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A Fixed Weekly Rota would be unfair given the usage patterns, and Standing Assignments risk the bitterness Midori warned about. I also vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,I'm definitely voting for the Paid Cleaning Service. It's the only way to ensure a consistent standard of cleanliness and stop the guesswork.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the cost, but since everyone else agrees it's the best way to avoid fighting and keep our friendship, I'll vote for the Paid Cleaning Service too.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have reached a consensus. I will vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. I'll cast my vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll also cast my vote for the Paid Cleaning Service.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,I'll cast my vote for the Paid Cleaning Service as well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'll cast my vote for the Paid Cleaning Service too.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
